  "body": "Sun-filled, single-level and superbly positioned for everyday ease, this inviting Settlers Grove home brings together privacy, flexibility and a lifestyle that is hard to beat.\r\n\r\nNorth-east facing and bathed in natural light, the home opens to a private, fully fenced backyard with lawn and established gardens. A sun-catching conservatory extends the living space and is an inviting spot to relax through the day, while the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area keeps daily life easy and connected. Internal-access garaging plus additional off-street parking complete the practical picture.\r\n\r\nThe original plans identify two bedrooms, and a lounge plus dining area*. That lounge provides an adaptable extra room that can suit guests, a home office, a second living area or the way you choose to live.\r\n\r\nThere is enough outdoor space to enjoy without a demanding upkeep list - a genuine bonus for buyers who want a garden, privacy and room to unwind without giving up their weekends.\r\n\r\nStep across the road and you are on the path to the Te Ara Tahuna Estuary Cycleway and Walkway, with scenic walking and cycling tracks close at hand. Orewa College (which the home is currently zoned for) and early childhood centres are within easy walking distance, while shops, cafes, restaurants and public transport are all conveniently nearby.\r\n\r\nWith Orewa Beach only minutes away, this is a location that makes everyday life simple while keeping the best of the coast within easy reach.\r\n\r\nIdeal for downsizers, first-home buyers, investors or anyone seeking a well-presented home with room to add their own touch over time, 26 Settlers Grove is ready to make an impression. Call Lane today.\r\n\r\n*Disclosure: The 'third bedroom' is shown on the plans as a lounge and is furnished as a lounge. Whilst it may meet the habitability and size/light criteria for a bedroom, purchasers should undertake their own due diligence if this is material to their decision to purchase.\r\n\r\nTo view all available documents please copy and paste the following link:  https://www.propertyfiles.co.nz/property/26Settlers\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
